  "content": "<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/qjtxfxfavz_img1.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>这个项目很有意思，看这张图就知道是什么用途的 <a href=\"https://dalle.party/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://dalle.party/</a>\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/qjtxfxfavz_img2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>noreferer算是 dofollow</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/qjtxfxfavz_img3.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/qjtxfxfavz_img4.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/qjtxfxfavz_img5.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>字体识别检测，需求还是挺大的，仅仅浏览器插件，就有200万的周活跃用户。</div>\n<div>既然AI都可以识别花花草草了，那么也肯定可以训练一个识别字体的AI。</div>\n<div>这个插件的开发者看起来是个华人 <a href=\"https://www.chengyinliu.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.chengyinliu.com/</a></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/qjtxfxfavz_img6.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/qjtxfxfavz_img7.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>当时是总用户30万，现在是周活200万，太牛了。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/qjtxfxfavz_img8.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>这个网站，仅仅字体检测页面，过去一年的流量就有差不多1亿\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/qjtxfxfavz_img8.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>",
